WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.650
All of us are at least 20 years old!

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.030
Amatsuki-kun.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.490
Yes, sir...

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.280
The presentation material you threw together is great.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.820
You're all set. We'll go with this.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.990
Thank you, sir!

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.500
<i>Good to go on my first try!</i>

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.290
Wednesdays are "No Overtime Days," huh...?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:28.920
Well why not, then?
Guess I'll clock out right on time today.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.510
It is Wednesday after all.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.720
I'm headed home, then!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:35.220
Good work today. Headed off in a rush, eh?

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.760
Got plans or something?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.470
Huh? Uhh... yeah?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.020
I'm home!

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.850
But no one else is...

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.520
<i>I actually don't have any plans at all.</i>

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:24.040
Maybe I should have stopped in somewhere...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.790
Heading straight home was kind of a waste huh...?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.040
Hmm?

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:32.040
Oh! Hadn't realized there was a sports gym nearby.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.130
"Courses starting from 7 PM"...

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.970
If I leave work on-time I could make that.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:41.010
<i>Well then, I'm off to attend yoga class!</i>

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:44.640
<i>I'm gonna hit the ol' running machine
to sweat out today's stress!</i>

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.890
That's <i>so</i> Tokyo!

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:48.560
I'm home!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.190
Oh, Michiru! What's with the goofy face?

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:56.530
I'm gonna join a trial session at the gym!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.860
Ah, that place in front of the station?
Gonna go on the weekends?

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:00.570
Nope!

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:03.950
I'm gonna clock out right on time
and go on Wednesdays!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.830
It's No Overtime Day!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.330
<i>After six PM, it's me time.</i>

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.120
R-right...

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.630
<i>And, who's that...?</i>

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:17.840
I'm looking forward to this!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.590
Okay, now stretch your back nice and straight!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.600
Our next pose is the sun setting in the west!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.520
Now the cat and cow pose!

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.350
Now the corpse pose.

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.480
Oh. I can do this one at least.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:34.190
The cobra pose!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.400
Nope...!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.730
Whew, I'm beat...

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:43.490
Maybe I overworked myself
trying to make sure I could leave on time.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.500
That'll be 4,570 yen!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.000
<i>We all fall victim to buying too much
when shopping on an empty stomach right...?</i>

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.000
I'm home!

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:59.010
Nao-san! What's wrong? Why do you look so lifeless?!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.220
Are you feeling-

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.010
Hmm?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:05.010
Oh, you just drank yourself to sleep, huh?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.350
I should have known...

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.390
Meow.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.520
I'm a cat. A purr-ty kitty!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.730
A cat... you say?

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:13.940
Meow!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:19.650
Oh! That cute little can of beer there!
That's Suiyoubi No Neko!

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.490
So you're a cat like on the can there?

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.150
Meow!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:24.240
Allow me to interpret!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.540
That "Meow!" just now was cat-anese for
"Yes, but not just because of that!" just so you kneow!

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.040
Meooow.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.420
The name comes from it being
a beer you drink in the middle of the week,

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.590
lounging about like a cat you kneow!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.710
Meow?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.010
Got it?

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.430
Not really at all. No. Could you speak normally?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:48.510
Sheesh. At least give me an
"Oh, Nao! You're so adorable!" or something.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:49.930
Or what, cat's got your tongue?

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:53.430
Well, don't just go full cat woman on me all of a sudden.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.440
Anyhow...

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.020
I actually picked up one myself.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:01.940
Figured it'd be a good treat for working so hard today.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.200
Well! Great minds think alike!

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.030
Nothing beats a post-workout beer, you know!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.200
I bet!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.790
I've never tried this one before though. Is it good?

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.080
Wait, you've never had it before?! Put that can down!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:17.750
You absolutely need to drink
your first in a tulip glass like this!

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.340
A "tulip glass"...?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.340
Suiyoubi No Neko is meant to be enjoyed
for its color and fragrance too.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.470
You'd be wasting it if you
just downed it right from the can!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.600
Oh, wow! It's got such a pale color.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:34.480
And it smells so citrusy and fruity too!

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:39.980
It's a Belgian style beer made with orange peels
and coriander to be nice and fruity.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.650
Now then, a toast to your first gym day.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.990
And my first Suiyoubi No Neko.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.990
Cheers!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.910
It's such a light and exquisite flavor!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:57.370
The carbonation isn't overpowering,
leaving it nice and mellow.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:01.250
And the refreshing hint of herbs
rise right up to the nose!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:04.510
It's not bitter at all, and is perfect
for people who aren't fans of beer!

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:09.390
You're still only 20, so I bet lots of your friends
aren't really big on beer right?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.010
Oh, yeah, you're right.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:17.230
It's that first bitter mouthful
and the acidity of it that turns them off.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.190
You should definitely have them try this
if you get the chance.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:21.110
Good idea!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.030
But hey, is there anything you don't really like drinking?

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.070
NOPE! Not even a single thing!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.780
Thought as much...

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:31.910
Is there any type of alcohol you don't like, then?

00:06:32.870 --> 00:06:35.410
I guess I don't really know.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.830
I haven't had all that much yet.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.170
Well what about food, then?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.090
Maybe stale potato chips or something?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:46.590
Anything else...?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:50.930
Bland edamame... super hard ray fin...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:55.350
But the most unforgivable of all, is lukewarm takowasa!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.440
There's no way you can enjoy it, unless the octopus
and wasabi are both nice and chilled!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.400
<i>Oh my...</i>

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.270
<i>Only 20 years old
and all she can talk about is bar food!</i>

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.400
<i>I bet it'll only get better from here!</i>

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:14.330
So I said I like pretty much any drink out there,
but a few years back that wasn't the case.

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:19.330
When I had my first beer after just turning 20...

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.420
This is AWFUL!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:25.840
I couldn't handle it.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.090
What?!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.590
That... that can't be...

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:32.930
You're the weird one for being able
to just drink anything from the start!

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:37.600
So what was it, then? What got you drinking?

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.600
Back when I was still 20,
I went for drinks at my senpai's house.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:43.850
What do you want to drink?

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:47.150
Beer is not really my thing, so...

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.820
I'll have that cute one there.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.400
Suiyoubi No Neko it is then!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.570
You've got a good eye! That beer is really good.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.410
<i>What?! This is beer?!</i>

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:59.870
<i>Can't turn back now, I already opened it...</i>

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.080
Meow!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.420
Wait, I can drink this! I can actually drink this!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.880
This beer isn't bitter at all!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.180
Meooooow~
My first beer was too bitter to handle.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:17.890
But once I tried Suiyoubi No Neko,
my whole outlook on beer changed!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.270
What started with "Hey, this is pretty good!"

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:22.390
ended up setting me down the path of the beer drinker.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.400
My journey would take me to places I never imagined.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:30.150
And every beer I ventured on to try,
felt like a meeting with destiny.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.530
And now I drink like this!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:35.030
Probably a bit too much, though...

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:39.910
That's still surprising to hear though.
I wouldn't have expected that from you.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.910
I was so young back then!

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:48.340
Now that you've had your first,

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:54.180
I'd be nothing but happy if it brought something new into your life too.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.510
Yeah...

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.930
I wonder if I might change like you did somehow...

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.680
It might be something right in front of your eyes.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.520
Nope! I still absolutely hate lukewarm takowasa!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.860
I'm still gonna eat it but...

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.690
You might grow to like it, you know.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.700
<i>Oh, wait, here's my change!</i>

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:21.200
<i>This isn't half as hard as last time!</i>

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.710
<i>It's actually kind of enjoyable to workout like this!</i>

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.500
<i>I could grow to like this!</i>

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.760
<i>A good workout deserves a relaxing Suiyoubi No Neko.</i>

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.470
Yup! That hits the spot!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.970
Oh, drinking are we? Count me in!

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.640
Guess what!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.680
I decided to join the gym!

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.230
All thanks to you, Nao-san!

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:50.940
Well! Hope you can stick with it!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:51.730
Me too!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.740
Just what exactly are you imagining right now?

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.280
Oh, nothing at all.

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.620
Come on.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:03.620
Meow!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.370
What?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:07.250
Come on, relax just like a kitty!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.330
M-meow...

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.800
Nope, nope, nope! You can't make me!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.510
Sheesh, what a party pooper.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:18.630
Gah! Nao-san you're always so-

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.220
Neow what's that supposed to mean?
What an a-paw-ling attitude!

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.140
Wednesdays just got a little more special.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.270
Enough with the cat puns just drop it already!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:25.560
Meow!
Wednesdays just got a little more special.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:26.020
Meow!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:02.360
Suiyoubi No Neko is a type of Belgian white ale.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:07.490
It's best when served not icy cold,
but at about 10°C to bring out the fragrance.

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:11.210
The coriander seeds and orange peels
give off such a refreshing aroma!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.080
Here's to another night!
